        after s3-cut reveal s3-cut-l duration 200
        after s3-cut-l reveal s3-n2 duration 240
        after s3-n2 trace s3-e23 duration 260
        after s3-e23 reveal s3-n3 duration 240
        after s3-n3 reveal s3-hist duration 240
        after s3-hist reveal s3-live duration 240
        after s3-live trace s3-motion duration 900
